{
  "id": "gen-neon-plasma-chrono-bloom",
  "name": "Neon Plasma Chrono-Bloom",
  "description": "A hyper-vibrant, time-dilated explosion of neon plasma tendrils that bloom and interlace like a digital, cyberpunk flora. The field clock lags with radius so the bloom opens outward from the centre, and white-hot filaments ignite where two plasma sheet families cross. Hold the mouse to pull a gravity well that dilates time under the cursor; bass thickens the plasma, mids widen and treble heats the filaments. New pass adds phase-slip caustic petals and rotating sepal ribs that brighten as filament heat rises.",
